{
  "id": "E366",
  "title": "Let’s Split the Bill",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2019-10-04",
  "synopsis": "Paul wants to treat Little Le to dinner, but Little Le won’t allow it.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1169/39a3955cd9c4dd11eae3b4d0091c733d4b2b02c9.mp3?1569842125",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我们AA吧\n\n保罗：今天晚上我们去饭店吃顿好的。我请你！\n小乐：哟，怎么突然要请我吃饭？\n保罗：我打工的工资今天到账了。\n小乐：这么快啊，真是太棒了！\n保罗：是啊，所以我特别高兴。\n小乐：不过，你打工也挺辛苦的。还是把钱省下来，多买一些你喜欢的书吧。\n保罗：没关系，吃顿饭用不了多少钱。\n小乐：别了别了，我们还是AA吧。",
    "traditional": "我們AA吧\n\n保羅：今天晚上我們去飯店吃頓好的。我請你！\n小樂：喲，怎麼突然要請我吃飯？\n保羅：我打工的工資今天到賬了。\n小樂：這麼快啊，真是太棒了！\n保羅：是啊，所以我特別高興。\n小樂：不過，你打工也挺辛苦的。還是把錢省下來，多買一些你喜歡的書吧。\n保羅：沒關係，吃頓飯用不了多少錢。\n小樂：別了別了，我們還是AA吧。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Let’s Split the Bill"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗：今天晚上我们去饭店吃顿好的。我请你！",
      "traditional": "保羅：今天晚上我們去飯店吃頓好的。我請你！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó jīn tiān wǎn shang wǒ men qù fàn diàn chī dùn hǎo de wǒ qǐng nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Let’s go to a restaurant and eat something good this evening. I will treat you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小乐：哟，怎么突然要请我吃饭？",
      "traditional": "小樂：喲，怎麼突然要請我吃飯？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè yō zěn me tū rán yào qǐng wǒ chī fàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Hey, how come you suddenly want to invite me to dinner?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "保罗：我打工的工资今天到账了。",
      "traditional": "保羅：我打工的工資今天到賬了。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wǒ dǎ gōng de gōng zī jīn tiān dào zhàng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: I got the salary from my part-time job today."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小乐：这么快啊，真是太棒了！",
      "traditional": "小樂：這麼快啊，真是太棒了！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè zhè me kuài a zhēn shì tài bàng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: So quick! That’s great!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "保罗：是啊，所以我特别高兴。",
      "traditional": "保羅：是啊，所以我特別高興。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó shì a suǒ yǐ wǒ tè bié gāo xìng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Yes, so I am especially happy."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小乐：不过，你打工也挺辛苦的。还是把钱省下来，多买一些你喜欢的书吧。",
      "traditional": "小樂：不過，你打工也挺辛苦的。還是把錢省下來，多買一些你喜歡的書吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè bú guò nǐ dǎ gōng yě tǐng xīn kǔ de hái shi bǎ qián shěng xia lai duō mǎi yì xiē nǐ xǐ huan de shū ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: However, you’ve worked very hard. You’d better save the money and buy more of the books you like."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "保罗：没关系，吃顿饭用不了多少钱。",
      "traditional": "保羅：沒關係，吃頓飯用不了多少錢。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó méi guān xi chī dùn fàn yòng bù liǎo duō shao qián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: It doesn’t matter. It won’t cost much for one meal."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "小乐：别了别了，我们还是AA吧。",
      "traditional": "小樂：別了別了，我們還是AA吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè bié le bié le wǒ men hái shi a a ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: No, no. Let’s still split the bill."
    }
  ],
